# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file").
# Round 10 "paths" (port/test/inputs/paths/README.md), an edited start (test coverage only, not story play).
# Start: boot both sides with GATE0_SRAM_IN=pe14_start.sav (the save's first 32 KiB: FNV-1a a658fac9).
# Resume Chapter (resume.keys), Eirika's Chapter 14, turn 1. Moulder (Bishop, class 0x2B): stat screen, the Restore,
# Barrier, Silence, Warp and Rescue target selections (each opened, then B), the item menu. Natasha (Bishop, 0x2C):
# Sleep and Hammerne selections, a move next to a door, the Unlock selection (DoUsePutTrap), the item menu over her
# Lightning (the item panel's stats), her Vulnerary (one-unit heal). Colm (Dancer): Dance, the ring (the special
# dance's selection). The unit list. Dozla attacks the cracked wall with the Devil Axe: the backfire kills him (P-27).
